# basePath Chapter5

::FirstContractOpenCh5 
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 
//todo need a bridge between end of comic with keela not picking up the phone. 

{@Player}   	Hey Pal... did Keela call me back?
{@PAL}      	No. 
{@PAL}      	But, good news, business is picking up. 
{@PAL} 			You have two companies offering you contracts. 
{@PAL}			Scroll through the contracts. You can switch anytime, but you'll have to start over.


::BeforeSupplyChainCh5
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Quinn}    Hey, Cowboy.
{@Quinn}    We're haulin' through space that cuts through pirate territory.
{@Quinn}    Its near Velos. Callie's neighborhood.
{@Quinn}	Callie's been taunting ol'Ovill over in Forsch. He'll be takin' blood pressure meds soon. 
{@Player}	Are your haulers on good terms with her? 
{@Quinn}  	 Well, she is a pirate. 


::AfterSupplyChainCh5
@trigger	    OnOverarchingLoaded 
@when 	        IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
{@Player} 	P.A.L., Fabrication is going to be… not glitched this time, right? 
{@PAL}      Frontier's automation is the most widely used technology in the system!
{@Player}   That doesn't mean it works.
{@Player}   Do we have any other options?
{@PAL}	Frontier Robotics has acquired all competing manufacturers. Standardization benefits everyone!
{@Player}   Arken used to do this manually and our microchips were the highest quality around!